"Prepare and record a real UI tour. Read vis_guide with tour first. look(source,pages,signIn?|signInRoute?) lists each page's real controls first → dry-run(script,tourId?,credentials?) → record(dryRunId,credentials?) → inspect(jobId,capture?) → check(jobId,verification); status/cancel use jobId. Submits nothing but a declared signIn. Only an explicit checked edition can be shown.\nRules: each picture is one screen (desktop 1440×960, phone 390×844), so every target a view names must be fully on it (use {op:\"reveal\", target}); every target must match exactly one visible control; take targets from the look, role and name first; tourId goes beside the script, never inside it; status waits for the job to rest or need the user (up to five minutes), so never sleep or poll in a loop."
